WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.733 --> 00:00:16.017
In the small village of Arbora, Italy, there lived an old carpenter.

2
00:00:16.778 --> 00:00:17.818
His name was Geppetto.

3
00:00:18.619 --> 00:00:20.439
He lived alone in his small house.

4
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:23.080
He had no wife and no children.

5
00:00:24.181 --> 00:00:27.182
When it was very late at night, he was often lonely.

6
00:00:28.322 --> 00:00:32.024
Every morning, Geppetto went into the forest to collect wood for carving.

7
00:00:34.148 --> 00:00:37.269
"This branch is heavy like a table leg.

8
00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:39.370
But it is too short.

9
00:00:40.331 --> 00:00:42.211
I don't like it," he said.

10
00:00:42.231 --> 00:00:48.694
"This log is wide like a bowl, but it is not deep enough.

11
00:00:49.654 --> 00:00:50.695
I don't like it.

12
00:00:51.795 --> 00:00:53.876
This is a good piece of wood.

13
00:00:54.556 --> 00:00:56.597
But it is too small.

14
00:00:57.458 --> 00:00:59.658
I can't make anything out of this."

15
00:01:01.379 --> 00:01:02.940
Geppetto threw the wood on the ground.

16
00:01:04.304 --> 00:01:05.745
"Ouch!" said a voice.

17
00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:08.927
"What? Who said that?

18
00:01:09.888 --> 00:01:10.989
Is someone there?"

19
00:01:11.890 --> 00:01:13.170
Geppetto asked the forest.

20
00:01:13.811 --> 00:01:14.952
He was very confused.

21
00:01:15.732 --> 00:01:19.655
He turned around and looked deep into the forest, but saw no one.

22
00:01:19.675 --> 00:01:26.079
"I must be imagining things," he said, and he kept walking.

23
00:01:26.099 --> 00:01:28.981
"Hey, don't leave me here!

24
00:01:29.482 --> 00:01:30.763
I'm not too small!

25
00:01:30.783 --> 00:01:32.464
I am good wood.

26
00:01:32.928 --> 00:01:34.769
You can make something out of me!"

27
00:01:35.289 --> 00:01:36.229
the voice said again.

28
00:01:36.949 --> 00:01:39.110
Geppetto looked back and was very surprised.

29
00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:41.150
It was a talking piece of wood!

30
00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:44.611
"I must be crazy!"

31
00:01:45.211 --> 00:01:45.992
Geppetto cried.

32
00:01:46.012 --> 00:01:48.812
"That's right, you are crazy!

33
00:01:49.272 --> 00:01:52.313
You left a fine piece of wood in the forest."

34
00:01:52.793 --> 00:01:57.795
"No, I must be crazy because I am talking to a piece of wood!"

35
00:01:57.815 --> 00:02:04.073
"Hey, I am made of very smart pine," the wood said, offended.

36
00:02:04.093 --> 00:02:08.297
"Yes, but you are only a piece of wood!"

37
00:02:08.317 --> 00:02:11.619
"Only a piece of wood?

38
00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:17.524
Take me home, sir, and I will show you I am not only a piece of wood."

39
00:02:18.325 --> 00:02:20.126
Geppetto was worried that he was crazy.

40
00:02:20.647 --> 00:02:22.188
But, he was also lonely.

41
00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:29.694
"This talking piece of wood might know interesting stories or funny jokes," he said to himself.

42
00:02:30.415 --> 00:02:31.856
He decided to take the wood home.

43
00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.481
"Hmm, what should I do with you?

44
00:02:38.341 --> 00:02:41.043
I could carve you into a rolling pin for dough.

45
00:02:41.783 --> 00:02:45.884
Or I could carve you into a small birdhouse," Geppetto said.

46
00:02:45.905 --> 00:02:49.106
"What? I don't want to be carved.

47
00:02:49.546 --> 00:02:51.047
That sounds painful!"

48
00:02:51.627 --> 00:02:52.567
said the piece of wood.

49
00:02:52.587 --> 00:03:00.010
"Well, if I don't carve you into something, you will only be a piece of wood."

50
00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:04.212
"Fine, you can carve me into something.

51
00:03:04.832 --> 00:03:08.893
But please, make it something interesting," said the wood, hopefully.

52
00:03:08.913 --> 00:03:11.654
"I don't want to be a rolling pin.

53
00:03:12.214 --> 00:03:13.654
And I don't like birds.

54
00:03:14.355 --> 00:03:17.335
I want to see the world and go on adventures."

55
00:03:17.355 --> 00:03:20.876
"How about a pipe?

56
00:03:21.577 --> 00:03:25.077
A rich traveler could take you with him," offered Geppetto.

57
00:03:25.097 --> 00:03:27.618
"No, I don't like smoke."

58
00:03:28.438 --> 00:03:30.659
"I could carve you into chess pieces.

59
00:03:31.339 --> 00:03:33.040
Every day would be a game!"

60
00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:35.597
said Geppetto, proud of this idea.

61
00:03:35.617 --> 00:03:39.098
"No, you don't understand.

62
00:03:39.859 --> 00:03:40.839
I want to run.

63
00:03:41.259 --> 00:03:42.300
I want to walk.

64
00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:43.960
I want to talk.

65
00:03:44.961 --> 00:03:46.202
How about a boy?

66
00:03:46.742 --> 00:03:48.683
Can you make me into a boy?"

67
00:03:48.703 --> 00:03:50.283
"A boy?

68
00:03:50.303 --> 00:03:53.885
Hmm Geppetto touched his nose, thinking.

69
00:03:53.905 --> 00:03:55.666
"Yes, please!

70
00:03:56.066 --> 00:03:59.508
I promise to be a good boy too," the wood said.

71
00:04:03.376 --> 00:04:07.378
"If you carve me into a boy, that means I will be your son.

72
00:04:07.979 --> 00:04:10.220
We can live together and have fun!"

73
00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:11.060
it added.

74
00:04:11.941 --> 00:04:14.422
The piece of wood didn't really want to live with Geppetto.

75
00:04:14.922 --> 00:04:17.284
It wanted to travel the world and go on adventures.

76
00:04:17.884 --> 00:04:20.305
But, the wood said this hoping Geppetto would agree.

77
00:04:20.325 --> 00:04:23.127
"A boy.

78
00:04:23.847 --> 00:04:26.529
Yes, I think that is a good idea.

79
00:04:27.089 --> 00:04:28.950
Let's get started right away!"

80
00:04:29.610 --> 00:04:32.072
said Geppetto, as he smiled a very big smile.

81
00:04:32.992 --> 00:04:34.335
He was happy to have a son.

82
00:04:34.816 --> 00:04:36.259
He was happy he was not alone.
